# Fontconfig keeps allocations created by FcFontRenderPrepare in process-lifetime
# caches on Linux. Skia's platform fallback path reaches this code through
# SkFontMgr_fontconfig::matchFamilyStyleCharacter(). Suppress only this known
# third-party stack while keeping LeakSanitizer enabled for all other leaks.
leak:FcFontRenderPrepare
